<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: an echo in our mind -->
  <WNA_ThoughtApathy.stages.an_echo_in_our_mind.label>我等心中之声</WNA_ThoughtApathy.stages.an_echo_in_our_mind.label>
  <!-- EN: We are walking on the confirmed path, working for our great career. I know I'm together with us, I will serve everything for us, we will serve everything for me. -->
  <WNA_ThoughtApathy.stages.an_echo_in_our_mind.description>我们行于天定的道途，致力于我等功业之落成。我心知我与我等同在，我将以一切奉献我等，我等亦将以一切托举于我。</WNA_ThoughtApathy.stages.an_echo_in_our_mind.description>
  
